  "steps": [
    "Cook noodles; drain. Grate garlic and ginger. Mix gochujang, powdered peanuts, coconut milk, water, garlic and ginger into sauce.",
    "Fry ground beef in oil on medium-high 1 min; season with salt; break up; fry 1 more min. Remove.",
    "Stir-fry frozen vegetables with a splash of water 30 sec covered; uncover; fry until water evaporates 3 min. Remove.",
    "Add noodles to pan; stir-fry 1 min.",
    "Return beef and vegetables; add sauce; toss 1 min. Done."
